From 1d4c72413b90c2cb14e73c21a3335bf3e2c2b2a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cromite <cromite@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Open-extension-popup-fullscreen

Keep the extensions three-dots context menu stable while pages are still
loading, and add a context menu entry to open an extension action popup as a
full-screen dialog without losing the current tab context.

This avoids losing "active tab" context for extensions like Tampermonkey and
prevents nested list menus from being dismissed by transient layout churn.

License: GPL-2.0-or-later - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-2.0-or-later.html
FILE:Open-extension-popup-fullscreen.patch
---
